#: data/io.github.trosinde.Annota.metainfo.xml.in:14
msgid ""
"Annota is a screenshot and annotation tool for GNOME. Capture a region, a "
"window or the whole screen and mark it up with arrows, callouts, numbered "
"steps, highlights and redaction. Every mark stays editable until you export."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.trosinde.Annota.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid ""
"Annota works entirely on your computer: no account, no cloud service and no "
"telemetry."
msgstr ""

